ca is only required to adopt the value with the highest vbal and that the local record's new ballot legitimately outranks an older committed vbal, which the review should test against the cited resolution code\\\"]}\njson.dump(s,open('submission-check.json','w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('ok')\nPY\ncd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run --submission submission-check.json 2>&1 | head -30\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
